    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11634" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαύγ-ασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>radiance, effulgence,</i> of light <i>beaming from</i> a
			luminous body, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτὸς ἀϊδίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					7.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.337
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				5.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				775.15
			</span></i>.</div>
